flowchart TD
  accTitle: Pairing makes the data boundary visible
  accDescr: The device sends a sanitized profile and any supplied recommendation snapshot before approval. Browser review can approve linking it to an account or deny linking; no deletion outcome is claimed here.
  A["Device detects and recommends locally"] --> B["Send profile and optional snapshot"]
  B --> C["Pending pairing record in the app"]
  C --> D{"Browser review"}
  D -->|"Approve"| E["Link device and show stored snapshot"]
  D -->|"Deny"| F["Do not link to the account"]
